<title>CHINA: HK dollar June M-3 rises 23.8 pct on year.</title>
<headline>HK dollar June M-3 rises 23.8 pct on year.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong Monetary Authority gave the following money supply figures as percentage changes:</p>
<p>					 June '97   May '97    June '96</p>
<p>    HK dollar M-3 (year-on-year)  +23.8	+23.8	+13.2</p>
<p>    HK dollar M-3 (month)	    +2.5	 +1.6	 +2.5</p>
<p>    HK dollar M-1 (year-on-year)  +15.5	+18.4	 +5.1</p>
<p>    HK dollar M-1 (month)	    -0.3	 -0.3	 +2.2</p>
<p>    HK dollar M-2 (year-on-year)  +24.1	+24.0	+13.5</p>
<p>    HK dollar M-2 (month)	    +2.5	 +1.6	 +2.5</p>
<p>Loans to finance visible trade of Hong Kong (year-on-year)</p>
<p>					  +3.6	 +4.1	 +7.5</p>
<p>Other loans for use in Hong Kong (year-on-year)</p>
<p>					 +26.1	+25.8	+14.2</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
</text>
